OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786279672
OL,3,CPolice investigating Ann Widdecombe's
OL,4,Cdeath 'reopen incident at Farage's
OL,5,Chome'
OL,7,FCounter-terror police investigating
OL,8,Fthe murder of Ann Widdecombe have
OL,9,Freopened a year-old probe into an
OL,10,Fincident at Nigel Farage's house, ITV
OL,11,FNews understands.
OL,13,FThe force said on Friday they had
OL,14,Freopened an investigation into an
OL,15,Fattempted burglary reported to the
OL,16,FMetropolitan Police in April 2025 in
OL,17,Fconnection with their inquiries into
OL,18,FMs Widdecombe's death.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
