OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786279672
OL,3,CPolice investigating Ann Widdecombe's
OL,4,Cdeath 'reopen incident at Farage's
OL,5,Chome'
OL,7,FSince then, CTP London said it had
OL,8,Fidentified a line of inquiry "which
OL,9,Fmay have been relevant" but was "not
OL,10,Fidentified and pursued by them at the
OL,11,Ftime", and also referred itself to the
OL,12,FIndependent Office for Police Conduct
OL,13,F(IOPC).
OL,15,FFarage revealed his home was targeted
OL,16,Fwith a lit incendiary device posted
OL,17,Fthrough the letterbox last year.
OL,26,@pD@^OUqD@WO]qD@aOUsD@EO]
