OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786279672
OL,3,CPolice investigating Ann Widdecombe's
OL,4,Cdeath 'reopen incident at Farage's
OL,5,Chome'
OL,7,FThe Reform UK leader, who stepped down
OL,8,Fas an MP in July, had not been home at
OL,9,Fthe time and told the Telegraph it had
OL,10,Ffortunately "burned itself out in the
OL,11,Fporch".
OL,13,FHe is understood to be "horrified" at
OL,14,Fthe potential connection between the
OL,15,Fincident and Ms Widdecombe's death.
OL,26,@sD@FO]
