OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786279672
OL,3,CPolice investigating Ann Widdecombe's
OL,4,Cdeath 'reopen incident at Farage's
OL,5,Chome'
OL,7,FMs Widdecombe, a Reform UK spokeswoman
OL,8,Fand former Tory minister, died on July
OL,9,F8 after she was hit over the head with
OL,10,Fa hammer 21 times at her home in
OL,11,FHaytor on Dartmoor, Devon, a court
OL,12,Fheard.
OL,14,FJoshua Kerry, 28, was charged with her
OL,15,Fmurder on July 20.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
