OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786279672
OL,3,CPolice investigating Ann Widdecombe's
OL,4,Cdeath 'reopen incident at Farage's
OL,5,Chome'
OL,7,F"As part of the ongoing investigation
OL,8,Fled by Counter Terrorism Policing
OL,9,FSouth East into the murder of Ann
OL,10,FWiddecombe, officers have reopened an
OL,11,Finvestigation into an incident
OL,12,Freported to police last year," said
OL,13,Fsenior national co-ordinator for
OL,14,FCounter Terrorism Policing, Vicki
OL,15,FEvans.
OL,26,@oD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786279672
OL,3,CPolice investigating Ann Widdecombe's
OL,4,Cdeath 'reopen incident at Farage's
OL,5,Chome'
OL,7,FShe added: "Given the nature of this
OL,8,Fmatter and the significant public
OL,9,Finterest in the investigation into Ann
OL,10,FWiddecombe's death, it was of critical
OL,11,Fimportance for us to provide this
OL,12,Fupdate."
OL,14,FCTP London said it made a "mandatory
OL,15,Fconduct referral" to the police
OL,16,Fwatchdog on Friday.
OL,26,@oD@LOUtD@HO]vD@[OUwD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
