PN,31408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786279672
OL,3,CPolice investigating Ann Widdecombe's
OL,4,Cdeath 'reopen incident at Farage's
OL,5,Chome'
OL,7,FAn IOPC spokesperson said on Friday:
OL,8,F"We can confirm that the IOPC has
OL,9,Fdecided to independently investigate
OL,10,Fthe conduct of a Counter Terrorism
OL,11,FPolicing London staff member following
OL,12,Fa referral received earlier today.
OL,14,F"The conduct relates to an allegation
OL,15,Fthe individual failed to identify and
OL,16,Fpursue a line of enquiry relating to
OL,17,Fan attempted burglary reported in
OL,18,FApril 2025.
OL,26,@pD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
