CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786279672
OL,3,CPolice investigating Ann Widdecombe's
OL,4,Cdeath 'reopen incident at Farage's
OL,5,Chome'
OL,7,F"Counter Terrorism Policing London has
OL,8,Fbeen notified of our decision, and no
OL,9,Ffurther information is available at
OL,10,Fthis early stage."
OL,26,@oD@AOU
